#: app/components/FeaturesList.tsx:52:18
msgid ""
"Pantheon helps not only with tournaments, it also can se used to log the "
"games you play in your local club"
msgstr "大会だけでなく、普段のクラブでの対局も記録できます。"

#: app/components/Layout.tsx:108:30
msgid ""
"Pantheon is a set of tools to record and show detailed riichi mahjong games "
"with recording assistance, admin panel and statistics service."
msgstr ""
"Pantheon は、対局アシスタント、管理画面、統計サービスを備え、リーチ麻雀の対局"
"を詳しく記録・表示するツール群です。"

#: app/components/FeaturesList.tsx:17:18
msgid ""
"Pantheon provides easy to use web-based assistant for your mobile device, "
"which you can use to add new hands and games"
msgstr ""
"スマートフォンのブラウザーから使えるアシスタントで、局や対局を簡単に記録でき"
"ます。"

#: app/components/FeaturesList.tsx:31:18
msgid ""
"Pantheon saves all game logs and provides a way to view them conveniently "
"both in mobile assistant and on main ratings page"
msgstr ""
"すべての対局記録を保存し、モバイルアシスタントとランキングページで閲覧できま"
"す。"

